[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 8763.11, "timestamp": "02:26:03", "text": "我今天错过了驾驶课。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8766.15, "timestamp": "02:26:06", "text": "我感到非常难过。啊，因为考试我的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8770.389, "timestamp": "02:26:10", "text": "驾驶考试在27号举行。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8776.389, "timestamp": "02:26:16", "text": "我的天啊，下周六就是24小时了！"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8779.67, "timestamp": "02:26:19", "text": "是圣诞节的第25天。星期日是26号。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8788.55, "timestamp": "02:26:28", "text": "我们需要工作。我们需要谈谈。是的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8791.429, "timestamp": "02:26:31", "text": "工作相关的事情。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8793.91, "timestamp": "02:26:33", "text": "你好。所以，是的，所有那些人"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8797.67, "timestamp": "02:26:37", "text": "从一开始我就在那里，而我当时并不在那里。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8800.309, "timestamp": "02:26:40", "text": "我打开我的板子，这样如果我……我就无法……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8802.55, "timestamp": "02:26:42", "text": "没能叫出你的名字，我真的非常抱歉。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8805.429, "timestamp": "02:26:45", "text": "所以"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8807.67, "timestamp": "02:26:47", "text": "即将到来的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8816.63, "timestamp": "02:26:56", "text": "来的时候，嗯，然后，然后，我们……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8818.23, "timestamp": "02:26:58", "text": "嗯"}]